Description: NVIDIA legacy 580.178.04 driver metapackage (Maxwell, Pascal, Volta (GeForce GTX 700/900/1000, TITAN V))
 The 580.178.04 driver from the NVIDIA 580xx legacy series, repackaged as a
 reproducible build for trixie.
 .
 Supported hardware: Maxwell, Pascal, Volta (GeForce GTX 700/900/1000, TITAN V).
 .
 UPSTREAM STATUS: Last driver branch for Maxwell/Pascal/Volta. NVIDIA still ships kernel-compat + security fixes here (the 590 branch drops these GPUs). Track upstream respins.


