Description: NVIDIA legacy 580xx prebuilt module for Linux 6.12.0-rt-amd64
 The nvidia/-modeset/-drm/-uvm modules from the 580xx series,
 compiled for the 6.12.0-rt-amd64 kernel ABI. No toolchain needed on the target.
